{"q":"3935","t":"Power Update After K-th Largest Insertion I","d":"Medium","p":true,"c":null,"h":["Keep the largest <code>k</code> elements separately. The answer is the smallest among them.","After inserting a value, rebalance the two sets/heaps so the “top <code>k</code>” side has exactly <code>k</code> elements. Since <code>abs(k<sub>i</sub> - k<sub>i-1</sub>) < 10</code>, only a few elements move each query.","Update <code>p</code> with fast modular exponentiation."],"m":"{\n  \"name\": \"powerUpdate\",\n  \"params\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"nums\",\n      \"type\": \"integer[]\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"integer\",\n      \"name\": \"p\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"integer[][]\",\n      \"name\": \"queries\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"return\": {\n    \"type\": \"list<integer>\"\n  }\n}","g":[{"name":"Array","slug":"array"},{"name":"Hash Table","slug":"hash-table"},{"name":"Math","slug":"math"},{"name":"Segment Tree","slug":"segment-tree"},{"name":"Sorting","slug":"sorting"},{"name":"Heap (Priority Queue)","slug":"heap-priority-queue"}]}